{"lang": "zh_TW", "eventid": "act49side", "eventName": "辭歲行", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "TA-4", "avgTag": "行動前", "storyName": "小雪崩", "storyInfo": "望私自放走被炎國軍隊追殺的矩獸，引起朔的不滿。面對除歲之事，朔主張循正道徐徐圖之，望則急求破局之策，二人矛盾激化。令出面說和，並向望解釋了自己從歲手下保全家人的設想。\n", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "70_g7_suilingcore", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.6, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$m_sys_act14mini_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "無故的執念、無根的掙扎、無謂的犧牲……自從數百年前起，你就一直憂心如焚。", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "我的醒覺被你劃分成四五百個週期，每個週期再分為十二，再分為三十，再分，再分……", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "每一分，每一秒，你都在盤算，都在恐懼著那個不知何時到來的“大限”……", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "不過幾場夢的時間罷了，我的我何時淺陋到如此地步？", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "subtitle", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 15, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 17, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "若是沒有一個意志，沒有一個主體，沒有一個願意為時間定下刻度的人，那麼光陰只是無謂的輪轉……", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$1"}, {"id": 18, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一如你在陵中度過的歲月。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$1"}, {"id": 19, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "無知無覺的你，又有何資格定義這段時間？", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$1"}, {"id": 20, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.6, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "呵……無非是夢而已。", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "為了注定消失的結局而歇斯底里的夢，就有資格了嗎？", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 24, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 26, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 28, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 30, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "70_g9_oldbattlefield", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 31, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_battlepresent", "loop": "true", "channel": "bgs", "volume": 0.0}}, {"id": 32, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.3, "channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$m_avg_riversnow_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 34, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "delay", "